  "question": {
    "text": "A square Lamina OABC of length 10 cm is pivoted at 'O'. Forces act at Lamina as shown in figure. If Lamina remains stationary, then the magnitude of F is :<br/><img src=\"assets\\qt0032_a43b3a51462c.png\"/>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "20 N",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "0 (zero)",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "10 N",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "$10 \\sqrt{2} \\mathrm{~N}$",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Since the lamina is equilibrium.<br/>$\\therefore \\mathrm{F}_{\\mathrm{net}}=0 \\& \\tau_{\\mathrm{net}}=0$<br/><img src=\"assets\\st0032_8e08852c78c3.png\"/><br/>$\\mathrm{T}_{\\mathrm{o}}=10 \\ell-\\mathrm{F} \\ell \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{F}=10 \\mathrm{~N}$"
  }
}